    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I’ve been working quietly behind the scenes on a few updates for Project 7: Escape Room. Some small bugs have been fixed, a few puzzles have been refined, and I’ve made minor improvements to lighting and performance across certain areas.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Each update is about polishing the experience and making the journey through Dr. Hillman’s mansion feel that bit more immersive.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks again for all the feedback and support. I really appreciate everyone who’s been playing and helping me make the game better with each update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chris",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
